  "guide.simple_bytestorage_dimension.portal.title": "Dimension: Rift Gate",
  "guide.simple_bytestorage_dimension.portal.body": "§eThe Silicon Plane§r is an optional dimension addon for high-tier storage progression.\n\n§eHow to build the Rift Gate§r\n1. Find a §bSilicon Rift§r biome in the Overworld (use a §bRift Compass§r!).\n2. Build a 4x5 (up to 12x12) frame of §bSilicon Basalt§r with a §bRift Gate Core§r in the bottom row.\n3. Supply §b100,000 FE§r to the Rift Gate Core.\n4. Right-click the Core with a §bCorrupted Cell§r (consumed) or §bRift Resonator§r (reusable).\n\n§eImportant§r: The gate feeds on ambient Rift resonance and §cONLY ignites inside Silicon Rift§r!",
  "guide.simple_bytestorage_dimension.resources.title": "Dimension: Biomes & Tier 2",
  "guide.simple_bytestorage_dimension.resources.body": "§eStage 1 Biomes§r\n- §bSilicon Terraces§r: safe entry plateaus with Quantum Clusters.\n- §bOptic Spirewood§r: glowing fiber spires and rich §bOptic Quartz Ore§r.\n- §bBus Canyons§r: deep rifts filled with §bLiquid Coolant§r and §bBusium Ore§r.\n\n§eHigh-Tier Rewards§r\nSmelt §bRaw Busium§r into §bBusium Ingots§r, combine with §bOptic Quartz§r into §bBusium Processors§r, and pair with §bLiquid Coolant§r to craft §b256k Byte Cells§r and §b64k Portable Byte Cells§r!",
