  "guide.simple_bytestorage_dimension.endgame.body": "§eAll 8 Biomes of the Silicon Plane§r\nUse §bShift + Right-click§r with the §bRift Compass§r inside the dimension to cycle between all 8 biomes:\n- §bCryo-Cache Wastes§r: Cryo-Silicate Ore.\n- §bCapacitor Flats§r: Fluxite Ore (64k Energy Byte Cell).\n- §bCorrupted Badlands§r: Entropy Ore & Quantum Clusters.\n- §bCloud Archive§r: Quantumite Ore (Quantum Core).\n- §bThe Null Core§r: Matrix Ore for the ultimate §c1M Byte Storage Cell§r!",
